        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Tongari Boushi to Mahou no Omise is the follow-up of Magician's Quest: Mysterious Times. It retains the Animal Crossing like gameplay of the previous game, however there is now an emphasis on owning and running a shop. These shops cover all types of goods from cakes to flowers to clothes to furniture. The shops products are created by playing mini-games.\n\nThe game also has further updates from the previous game. There is now a new castle location where players can hear the king's opinion on their store. The number of students, teachers, spells, incantations, furniture, cd's, insects, and fish have all been increased too.",
